assign(max_seconds,90).
set(prolog_style_variables).
op(400, infix, "*").
formulas(assumptions).
X*X = X.
(Y*X)*X = Y*X.
(X*Y)*X = Y*X.
((Z*X)*Y)*X = Z*(Y*X).
(((Z*X)*Y)*X)*Y = (Z*X)*Y.
(Z*X = Z & Z*Y = Z) -> X*Y = Y*X.
% (E6') hypotheses: aca=a, ada=a, dbd=d, cd=dc, bcb = a(cd)a
c*a = a. d*a = a. b*d = d. c*d = d*c. c*b = (c*d)*a.
end_of_list.
formulas(goals). a*b = a. end_of_list.
